note [09_random_library.epp: Demonstrating the Random library]

add the "Random" library

note [Define a random number variable:]
define 'Random number' as a random number between 1 and 100
say "Here is a random number between 1 and 100! It is ", 'Random number'

note [Inline it's a random number expression:]
say "Heres your random number!", it's a random number between 1 and 100

note [Say the number between 1 and 5:]
say "Rolling a 5-sided dice: ", the number between 1 and 5
